window.products.push({"id":1055012,"name":"WB31X24998 WB31X24738 Griddle Replacement Parts For GE Stove Parts Top Griddle Plate General Electric Gas Range Parts Reversible Cast Iron Center Grid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MKt8dC6SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【UPGRADE HEAVIER AND MORE DURABLE GE GRIDDLE】 The double sided ge griddle made of matte enamel cast iron that heavier and more durable to ensure long-life lasting. The cast iron square griddle with unique flat surface that provides space for placing items, and well-designed about reversible cook surface that you can use two sides. ✅【DIMENSIONS & MATERIAL】 1 Pack 19.6 x 10.2\" high quality matte enamel cast iron ge griddle plate for stove cooktop parts. ✅【COMPATIBLE GE OEM PART GRILL GRIDDLE NUMBER】WB31X24998，WB31X24738 and more ge stove griddle. ✅【PLEASE NOTE】 Please kindly compare with your stove original parts SIZE and MODEL before you order or EMAIL us. We will help you to find right parts to fits your ge range. ✅【COMPATIBLE WITH GE GAS STOVE MODEL NUMBER】 JGBS66REKSS，JGB735SPSS JGBS61RPSS，PGB935YPFS，JGB660YPFS，JGBS86SPSS，JGB660DEJ1BB JGB660DEJ1WW，JGB660DEJ2BB，JGB660DEJ2WW， GB660DEJ3BB， JGB660DEJ3WW， JGB660DEJ5BB，CGB500P3M1D1， PGB930SEJ1SS， PGB930SEJ2SS， PGB930SEJ3SS， PGB930SEJ4SS， PGB930SEJ5SS， PGB930SEJ6SS， PGB930SEJ7SS，PCGB911DEJ1WW， PCGB911DEJ2WW， PCGB911DEJ3WW， PCGB911EEJ1ES， PCGB911EEJ2ES and more. ✅【REVERSIBLE DESIGN】 The ge middle griddle plate can be placed directly on the burner grates, both sides can be cooked, the ribbed side can hold meats, fish, poultry, and hamburgers deliciously to sear in their natural flavor; The smooth side is perfect for the delicate foods like scrambled eggs, pancakes, grilled cheese sandwiches, pan cakes, toast bread, tortillas, fajitas, veggies. Non-stick surface by seasoned oil before your cook. ✅【HIGH QUALITY AND UNIVERSAL】The ge flat iron griddle compatible with all types of stove tops, fit comfortably to gas stove burners and can be used for baking in an oven. ✅【EVEN HEATING AND SAFETY】Samsung cast iron pan maintains a consistent temperature, heats quickly and evenly to cook your food with wondrous flavor using less oil. High ridges of the ge cast iron grill griddle plate keeps oil from spilling out while providing safe gripping points. ✅【SEASONING】The griddle needs to be seasoned for the first time to get a smooth and non-stick surface.【HOW TO MAKE NON-STICK SURFACES】1. Wash and dry the griddle completely. 2. Rub the Vegetable oil (or others) into the griddle with a clean cloth, making sure it coats the griddle evenly. 3. Place the griddle on the stove and cook it for a while. 4. Then allow it to cool. Do not run it under cold water or it will crack. 5. Repeat the process of oiling, cooking and cooling two or three more times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MKt8dC6SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Allstare","source_asin":"B09THJFTPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09THJFTPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09THJFTPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
