window.products.push({"id":1055181,"name":"RYPHER New Plastic Hanger Clips, 20 Pack Hanger Clips for Plastic Hangers [Laundry Clips] Clothes Clips for Use with Plastic Clothes Hangers. Made wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.53,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BWgCXhiLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We believe that you should have the freedom to tailor YOUR fashion At RYPHER, our vision is to allow you to model your own unique style . We give you the products that help you organize and arrange your best outfits. Our plastic hanger clips are the versatile solution to shape your clothing storage. Our unique premium no-slip design grip clips make sure your fabric does not snag or tear when releasing from the hanger. Adjust your clip placement to cater for all different sizes of clothing types. Use RYPHER clips for more than just hanging up clothes These robust clips are a useful addition to arts and crafts projects, giving you the option to hang artwork, pin memos, bind papers and more. These versatile clamps can also be used to preserve packaged foods and seal freezer bags . RYPHER hanger clips can be used as a multipurpose solution to hang laundry. This great alternative to clothespins and laundry pegs will help dry your clothes faster, offering a practical solution that allows you to stack your items and keep them neat, tidy and in order. Product Details Dimensions - 2.6” x 0.8” x 1.0” Dimensions - 2.6” x 0.8” x 1.0” Value pack - 20 premium hanger clips included Value pack - 20 premium hanger clips included Multi-purpose - Many different uses around the home, office and kitchen Multi-purpose - Many different uses around the home, office and kitchen Functional - Keep your clothes neat, tidy and organised Functional - Keep your clothes neat, tidy and organised Environmentally Friendly – 100% recyclable plastic, keep the oceans clean Environmentally Friendly – 100% recyclable plastic, keep the oceans clean Premium quality 20 pack Available in a pack of 20, there are more than enough plastic hanger clips to meet all of your needs. Get your plastic clips for clothes hangers, click \" Add to cart \" today and give your closet the smart restoration that you that you desire!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BWgCXhiLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RYPHER","source_asin":"B07HDGCCFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HDGCCFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HDGCCFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1055182,"name":"Banneton bread Proofing Basket set Emporoi 10 inch Round & 8 inch Oval Sourdough proofing basket kit with dough scraper + bread lame scoring tool + wa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EkmxwPxfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking to Make Delicious Bread? No Need To Worry Anymore! Our bread proofing basket allows to produce floury ring patterns and thousands of European style loaves but just need very little time! Natural rattan cane material, the dough has been shown to be whipped from the surface of the natural rattan to form a crispy round bread that is well removed and released.With a dough scraper, washable linen cloth, and Bread Lame. The dough scraper also which is a good size for mixing and scraping. As long as you want it, you can make your bread look more beautiful with bread Lame! Bread Lame Scoring Tool with dough scrapper. It has a plastic handle for a better grip and easy to use . Our linen cloth help shape the dough and prevents the dough from proofing into each other. 100% Natural Rattan Made from ultra-durable natural Indonesian rattan, free of strains and chemicals. Smooth surface and don't need to worry about hurting hands Creating Delicious Bread Not only make beautiful and delicious bread but also let your friends and family enjoy the art of creating delicious healthy bread. 6 Pieces Bakers Tool Set Includes: 1 x Bread Lame 1 x Dough Scraper 2 x Proofing Basket (8\" Inch & 10\"Inch ) 2 x Washable Linen Cloth Emporoi Best Proofing Basket Set for Family and Bakers!!! Affordable & Great Gift Emporoi 2 set proofing basket is helpful for a baker and people who like to make fresh and healthy bread by themselves. A housewife can make delicious for their little child and it will make much more fun to the family. Also, it's a good gift for friends and they will be surprised at your gifts! The bread basket is made of purely natural rattan which can effectively ensure that the proofing basket does not change and keep it dry after clean. Also, it can make the dough a crispy round crust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EkmxwPxfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EMPOROI","source_asin":"B08BPB5HN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BPB5HN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BPB5HN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
