window.products.push({"id":1055314,"name":"Chicology Roman Shade, Cotton and Jute Fabric, Privacy, Kyoto Cappuccino (Cream), 30\"x72\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VKVRhxWwL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Innovation for Chic. Chicology roman shades create an elegant backdrop. This natural woven fabric lets in just the right amount of light. It is soft to the touch and has a breathable, airy look. It is designed to be light filtering during the day and privacy at night. The natural woven fabric has a unique texture. It provides an added beauty and interest to the shade. The neutral color is sure to complement virtually any decor. It has a soft and elegant fold when rolled up and looks beautifully stylish by itself or with curtains. The installation is very easy. The valance and shade come pre-assembled, so you just need to install the brackets and insert the shade. An industry standard ½-inch deduction will be made to the width to ensure a snug fit. The total tip-to-tip (bracket-to-bracket) width will be ½-inch shorter than the measurement you purchase. It is capable of either inside or outside mount. This shade is durable and ideal for living room, kitchen, bedroom, dining room, sun porch, powder room, family room, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VKVRhxWwL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHICOLOGY","source_asin":"B005EFE1CE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005EFE1CE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005EFE1CE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1055315,"name":"Everspread 800 Thread Count Cotton Bed Sheets (4 Piece Sheet Set) - King Size, Dark Gray. 100% Natural Long Staple Cotton Bedding, Ultra-Soft & Silky ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813BWQDAM3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHATS INCLUDED: Our King Size Cotton Sheet Set Includes 1 Flat Sheet (108\" x 102\"), 1 Fitted Sheet (78\" x 80\" + 17\"), 2 Pillowcases (20\" x 40\"), and 1 Soft Cotton Drawstring Bag. 100% NATURAL LONG-STAPLE COTTON. 800 THREAD COUNT – Luxury Sateen Weave. Our sumptuously silky and luxuriously soft Refined Bed Sheets. The Refined Sheet Set effortlessly transforms any room into a sophisticated space. Enjoy luxury comfort with 800 thread-count. Features pure extra-long staple cotton fibers that create exceptionally strong yarns that resist piling, to stay smooth wash after wash. These sheets are wrinkle-resistant and breathable SHORT & LONG SIDE LABELS. Thoughtfully placed on the inside of your fitted sheets to make the bed-making process quicker and easier. Our fitted sheet is designed with durable stitching and an all-around stretchable elastic to ensure it fits securely to your mattress. The deep pocket fitted sheet fits mattresses up to 16” in height. Your sheets SUSTAINABILITY MEASURE: At Everspread, we believe it is our duty and responsibility to commit to sustainability. Our sustainability measures focus on sourcing naturally produced materials, working with ethical factories, and creating recyclable and reusable packaging to eliminate any use of single-use plastic. From beginning to end, we are committed to making high quality products in a responsible manner. FOREVER GUARANTEE. At Everspread, we are dedicated to delivering the best product experience possible. We strive to make products that last. If they don’t, we've got you covered. This is our lifetime promise to you. Questions? Our dedicated Customer Support Team is here to support you through your entire journey with Everspread.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813BWQDAM3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Everspread","source_asin":"B07YF3ZKR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YF3ZKR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YF3ZKR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
