window.products.push({"id":1055378,"name":"Fohufo Metal Storage Cabinet with Doors and 4 Adjustable Shelves, 72-Inch Large Space Lockable Steel Garage Cabinet for Home, Office, Living Room, Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DsLWFsdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【WHAT IS THE PURPOSE OF A METAL CABINET】- Adding a metal cabinet to your storage arsenal is a great idea and a fast way to improve your working conditions. Choose our metal storage cabinet for you to give your workspace an upgrade. Our metal locker offers extra storage space, keeps the insides secure and looks great in kitchens, laundry rooms, and sports facilities. 【COMPACT DESIGN】- Our Metal cabinet is built to endure heavy-duty use, the cabinet is made from robust reinforced steel and protected with an elegant gray powder-coated finish. Engineered to endure harsh industrial environments and heavy use, the robust cabinet structure will safely hold basic workplace equipment. Classic, neutral aesthetic ensures the cabinets look appropriate in any modern commercial setting, as well as educational institutions such as universities and schools. 【ADJUSTABLE SHELVES】- Our Metal Storage Cabinet has 4 adjustable shelves making it appropriate for garage and/or home use. The adjustable shelves will give you the freedom to use this for what you want, whether you’re a handy person looking to store your tools, or want to keep important paperwork away from the kids. The dimensions are 32’’ L x 16” W x 72”H, giving you plenty of room, also coming with a 1-year service guarantee. If you want the absolute best for your garage, look no further. 【THREE-POINT LOCK SYSTEM】- The metal storage cabinet offers an upgraded version of the three-point lock system for maximum security. The steel rods are also thickened to provide higher security. What might make this cabinet stand out for you is the environmentally friendly spray paint which also makes it rust-resistant. The load-bearing capacity is total 500 pounds, suitable for garage tools, and ideal for long term use. You can’t go wrong here if you’re looking for amazing security and top of the range features. 【EASY ASSEMBLE AND SERVICE】- The steel storage cabinet are made for easy use and a user-friendly experience. The cabinet easy to install, saving time and lots of hassle. These metal cabinets are thoughtfully assembled from the best steel and are built to last. For increased value when you purchase, these cabinets feature a 1 year labour and parts replacement, to provide assurance that you're securing an amazing product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DsLWFsdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fohufo","source_asin":"B08QZCJLDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QZCJLDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QZCJLDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
