window.products.push({"id":1055426,"name":"Portable Foldable Fan for Travel, Esemoil 8\" Oscillating Rechargeable Fan with Remote, 10800mAh Rechargeable Folding Standing Table Fan with 4 Speeds,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KwyZFLCaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏖️𝟖\" 𝐅𝐨𝐥𝐝𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐒𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐝 & 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐤𝐭𝐨𝐩 𝐅𝐚𝐧 - Adopted the newest folding telescopic design, this travel fan can easily meet your needs for different heights of the fan. Lightweight, collapsible, and height telescoping will make it become the best choice for travel. Besides, it could be used as a floor fan & table indoor fan, suitable for summer travel, camping, picnic, fishing, and other outdoor activities. 🔄𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐞𝐫 𝐒𝐢𝐥𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐎𝐬𝐜𝐢𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐅𝐚𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐑𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐭𝐞 - Equipped with noise reduction technology with seven fan blades, this 110° smooth oscillating portable fan can operate with low 30db noise. In the meantime, it also has 4 wind modes that are soft /cool /strong /natural, and a remote control function, allowing you to easily adjust the wind speed gear, swing angle, and timing without walking around. 🔋𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐞𝐫 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐓𝐢𝐦𝐞 & 𝐅𝐚𝐬𝐭 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐢𝐧𝐠 - Built-in 10800Mah rechargeable battery, this table fan can be improved use time to 7-35 hours after a full charge. Let you no longer worry about charging during travel. Besides, the High-quality Type-C cable will make it a fast charging function that can be fully charged in 6 hours. You can free choose the USB (5V/2A), compatible with a PC/laptop, power bank, AC adapter, car charger, and etc USB-enabled power sources to charge it. 🧽𝐌𝐮𝐥𝐭-𝐀𝐧𝐠𝐥𝐞 𝐀𝐝𝐣𝐮𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 & 𝐃𝐞𝐭𝐚𝐜𝐡𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐂𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐧 - This table fan is multi-angle adjustable(axial rotation - 100°, back and forth rotation - 180°). And its height can adjust which can be stretched from 14.76\"(37.5cm) to 40.6\"(103cm). In addition, its front grille is detachable and easy to clean. Designed with an anti-slip silicone pad on the bottom of the base, makes the fan more stable. ⏳𝐇𝐮𝐦𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐳𝐞𝐝 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧 & 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐯𝐞𝐥 𝐓𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐠 - This travel fans design for 4 Wind modes, soft /cool /strong /natural, and powerful wind to keep you cool in summer. It can be used as a personal table fan or a vertical fan, small and easy to carry, you can easily put the ventilator in your backpack or drawer. When you want to sleep, you can set up the timing for 0.5H-1H-2H-4H. Please contact us anytime if any questions about our fold telescopic fan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KwyZFLCaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"esemoil","source_asin":"B0BYZSKGQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYZSKGQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYZSKGQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
