window.products.push({"id":1055474,"name":"HBlife Drawer Dividers Organizer 8 Pack, Clear Plastic Adjustable Drawer Separators 3.2 Inches High, Expandable from 11-20 Inches for Dresser Clothing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EvJGPMJmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP YOUR DRESSER DRAWERS ORGANIZED: Do you have trouble finding your socks and underwear in those stuffed and messy dresser drawers? These dresser drawer dividers are going to help you organize your clothes and keep your drawers neat and organized at all times! EASY INSTALLATION: Installation is quick and easy, no hardware or tools required. Just stick the double sided tape on both sides of the divider, peel off the white tape, put it in the drawer, unfold it to adjust to the correct position, then stick the divider into the drawer. Before you buy the dividers, make sure you measure your drawers first. EXPANDABLE DESIGN: Both sides of the telescopic clapboard can be expanded from 11 inches to 20 inches, and the total length of the telescopic clapboard is 20 inches. To maintain the stability of the telescopic clapboard, it is recommended that the maximum value of the telescopic clapboard does not exceed 19 inches. MULTIPURPOSE: These drawer organizers can be installed in any drawer in your house or office. Ideal for keeping drawers organized and easy to find the items what you need. Perfect for organizing clothes, kitchen utensils, office desk supplies, makeups, bathroom clutter and more. STURDY MATERIAL: Made of durable clear plastic, waterproof and moisture-proof, double-sided tape can be used on the end of the drawer divider to fix and cushion, effectively protect the drawer from scratches and damage. Free combination according to your needs, organize drawers neatly. SIZE & PACKAGE: There are 8 pieces of clear drawer dividers and each divider is equipped with 4 pieces of double-sided tape. The size of the telescopic partition is 11 x 3.2 inches, the longest dimension after the expansion is 20 x 3.2 inches, and the thickness of each layer is 0.5 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EvJGPMJmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HBlife","source_asin":"B0B7JWV5JF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7JWV5JF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7JWV5JF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
