window.products.push({"id":1055547,"name":"Sleemon Memory Foam Mattress Topper, Extra Firm Mattress Topper with Removable Bamboo Organic Cover, Double-Layer Breathable Bed Topper, Firm Pain-Rel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jS-rfOLBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Firm mattress topper: Sleemon memory foam mattress topper adopts a double-layer design which has better support. Its first layer is high resilience memory foam. Even if lying on it for a long time, it will not collapse. The second layer is a highly supportive special foam, which can better maintain the firmness of the entire topper. The combination of two layers can effectively provide support for back. It is ideal for people who like firm mattresses topper. Breathable mattress topper: Our mattress topper queen adopts an innovative foam created by a unique technology. Combined with the 40D high density memory foam which allows air to circulate freely inside the foam then allowing moisture to evaporate faster. And excellent breathability of the queen mattress topper also increase cooling, so you won't wake up with hotness and sweaty at night. Improve sleep quality: Sleemon firm mattress topper queen is all designed for you to get a more comfortable sleep. The memory foam mattress pad provide you with support as well as optimal air circulation whenever and wherever you need it. Enjoy our breathable, supportive design that evenly distributes body heat and relaxes your muscles for a more restful sleep. Bamboo fiber cover: We have equipped the mattress toppers with a removable bamboo fiber cover. It is cooler and more breathable than the common material of cover and dissipates heat well. At the same time this fabric is so soft that avoids pain caused by tossing and turning while sleeping. The removable and machine washable design also prevents dust and stains, keeping the matressess topper queen memory foam clean and extending the life of the foam bed topper. Instruction for use: All memory foam mattress topper on the market are vacuum packed, please open it within 48 hours and leave it in a ventilated place for 24 hours to let it expand and ventilate. Please note that this topper is suitable for people who like to sleep on firm mattress topper queen or people with bad lumbar spine, if you have any problems after receiving the goods please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jS-rfOLBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleemon","source_asin":"B0B8VKRP4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8VKRP4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8VKRP4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
