window.products.push({"id":1055556,"name":"Swissmar Monte Rosa 9 Piece Cheese Fondue Set, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OWPMHv+8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Swiss Traditional Series brings authentic Swiss fondue sets for an authentic Swiss tradition. Cheese fondue is a traditional Swiss dish, fun to serve and enjoyable to eat. This 9 piece ceramic cheese fondue set includes a 9 inch black ceramic fondue pot, a traditional wrought iron rechaud, six heat resistant 11 inch stainless steel 3 tine fondue forks with dark wood handles and an 8 hole fondue burner. The ceramic pot is made with authentic Swiss clay and has a 2.8 quart capacity. It is safe for use on cooktop, in oven, in microwave, and with traditional fondue fuelled burners. Swiss traditional ceramic cheese pots are ideal for cooking at low heat, the larger pot keeps the temperature from getting too hot and burning the cheese. These pots show “crackling” – an important process that allows the glaze to expand during heating. Although they may eventually become discolored after several uses due to food particles entering the cracks, this is perfectly safe and normal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OWPMHv+8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swissmar","source_asin":"B0064OM1YY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0064OM1YY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0064OM1YY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1055557,"name":"Harper & Bright Designs Twin Loft Bed with Desk , No Box Spring Needed,Solid Wood Loft Bed with Angled and Built-in Ladder(Grey (with Desk))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iNglZHZlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The loft bed perfectly serves homes with limited space. It takes advantage of the floor space, and allows for a cozy rest, extra work and play space and makes a great piece of furniture for growing families. The space underneath the twin size loft bed is a good place for your kids to read, do homework or play and create their own world to be explored. Coming with spacious desk, the loft bed helps to do homework, display decorations, or to place a laptop This muti-functional loft bed is crafted from a solid pine wood frame and MDF for quality and durability. The stable ladder put on front and side of the bed which is great for kids to climb on bed for safe and sound sleep. High Guardrails are attached for safety concerns This loft bed is designed to last for a lifetime as well as maintain its stylish look with clean white/grey lines that blend well with the surroundings. Our designs promote both comfort and elegance No box spring needed loft bed, comes with 10 slats for perfect mattress support (mattress not included);bunk beds with desk comes with clear instruction that will guide you through all steps, customers’ satisfaction is our top priority, please contact us if you have any questions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iNglZHZlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harper & Bright Designs","source_asin":"B08NXCM2FJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NXCM2FJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NXCM2FJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
