window.products.push({"id":1055562,"name":"PIIDUOO 114ct Christmas Balls Ornaments for Xmas Tree - Shatterproof Small Christmas Tree Decorations Rose Gold Pink & White Balls Ornament Bulk, 1.18","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RxbNTglyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHATTERPROOF ORNAMENTS Bulk- Christmas Balls ornaments are made of solid, eco-friendly plastic material that have passed international quality certification, it's better for families with kids, pets. Shatterproof balls ornaments combine beauty, luster of real glass with unbreakable practicality of plastic. Due high quality, we suggest you reusing our Christmas ornaments. CLASSIC & EXQUISITE CHRISTMAS ORNAMENTS - These muticolored Christmas ornaments feature a variety of classic and popular Christmas elements, including small christmas balls, candy, stocking, snowflake etc. They will be perfect for decorating your tree and become part of your holiday tradition. PERFECT HOLIDAY BALLS ORNAMENTS - Shatterproof ornaments make great addition to your holiday decoration. Perfect home decor for a variegated display of Christmas, wedding, engagement, anniversary, party, as decorative hanging ornament on trees, wreaths, table centerpieces, fireplaces, around banisters, indoor or outdoor decorations. It is also a best choice for gifts. EASY DECORATING & HANGING ORNAMENTS: Each round ball ornament equips a small hook with shiny rope to hang balls ornaments easily. It saves time wearing rope, makes it easier to experience more fun of decorating your home. Our shatterproof balls ornaments are very light weight, don't worry about crushing your tree. It makes easy hanging on any places you need to decorate. DIFFERENT SIZE & UPGRADED PLASTIC BOX: Various shapes, and size are suitable for most trees. With upgradding the thickness of plastic box and shatterproof test, don’t worry about Christmas balls being damaged during transportation. If you have any questions, please contact us immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RxbNTglyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PIIDUOO","source_asin":"B09BFFPKQZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BFFPKQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BFFPKQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
