window.products.push({"id":1055645,"name":"Oval Shape cast iron Steak Plate Sizzle Griddle With Wooden Base Grill Fajita Serving Plate Enameled Coating","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31kaghMGZqL._AC_.jpg","description":"In 1980, Fuji Merchandise Corporation was established in Los Angeles as a subsidiary of Fuji Merchandise, Inc. in Yokohama, Japan. As an importer of quality products from Japan, our core product-line back then was lacquer-ware from the Shizuoka region, wholesaling primarily to small gift shops in the Los Angeles and San Francisco area. Our product-line has since evolved to include porcelain tableware, kitchen products, cast iron teapots, premium Japanese green tea, paper products, kimonos, professional grade knives, Japanese decorative products, Japanese giftware items, and a wide array of products for the restaurant supply industry. Over the years, our company has grown to not only have a presence in the United States, but also worldwide. We also export to countries such as Holland, France, Italy, Great Britain, Australia, Singapore, Brazil, Canada, Mexico, and the Middle East. Here at Fuji Merchandise, it has been our focus and goal to provide our clients with unique, novel and exciting products, competitive pricing, along with attentive customer service. As we continue to receive new items from Japan and China, we invite you to check out our “NEW PRODUCTS” section of our website for the latest additions to our ever growing product-line.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31kaghMGZqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FMC","source_asin":"B07KCL6QKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KCL6QKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KCL6QKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1055646,"name":"Shelf Liner for Kitchen Cabinets,12Inch x 20FT, Non Adhesive, Kitchen Drawer Liner Roll for Refrigerator/Pantry/Shelves/Under Sink, Waterproof Double ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OjuErYRFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Eva Safe Material BPA Free】The shelf liner is made of high quality food grade EVA material, which is strong and recyclable, we guarantee it will not tear or wrinkle, and the soft texture will keep it from curling as often as other harder ones. Even when stored with sharp utensils or heavy objects. Eco-friendly, no odor, can be in direct contact with food, fruits and vegetables. 【Non-slip Double-sided Pad】The drawer liner is designed with an elegant texture, one side is long strips of texture and printed patterns, and the other side is a non-stick smooth surface that prevents items from slipping and bunching on wire racks or tables, perfect for keeping your plates, bowls , knife and fork, cabinet safety. Non-slip, non-stick handle bottom helps hold liner securely in place when moving items in and out of cabinets or drawers. 【Easy to Cut】Kitchen drawer liners come in the most common pre-cut sizes. Easy to keep flat and cut the liner into various shapes. For unique sizes and shapes, you can simply trim kitchen cabinet liners with household scissors. Simply place the liner in a drawer or cupboard and trim off excess material. 【Waterproof and Easy to Clean】The cabinet liners for kitchen are waterproof and dustproof, keeping your kitchen cabinets, refrigerators and drawers organized and preventing grease and spills. Non-adhesive shelf liners are easily removable and washable with mild soap and water. And easily removes stains without leaving any residue. No sticky residue is left on the rack after replacement. 【Multipurpose Liner】Cabinet liners for shelves can be used in your refrigerator, kitchen cabinets, metal shelves, pantry, bathroom drawers, laundry room, desk drawers, under sink liners and shoe racks. Keeps them tidy and stain-free. It's perfect for organizing your home storage, DIY any non-slip surface with our liners, from trays to open bookshelves, or even customizable placemats, feel free to use as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OjuErYRFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFASOAD","source_asin":"B0C6Q9QQM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6Q9QQM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6Q9QQM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
