window.products.push({"id":1055659,"name":"MUB Perfume Refill Pump Tools, Perfume Dispenser with Adapter Tools for Perfumes Transfer to empty bottles, Include 2 Syringe for Replacement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vC6l9Fl6L._SL1418_.jpg","description":"HOW TO USE: Uses the syringe to dispense, combining two inventive adapters to extract original perfume from the original perfume bottle and inject the perfume into another original perfume bottle or other smaller clip / screw travel bottle. (Extraction adapter 2pcs + Injection adapter 2pcs + 10ml syringe 2pcs + Gift box）The adapter is small,so please take care of it when open the package to prevent losing ADAPTER FOR EXTRACTION: Add the extraction adapter on the syringe, with the other end of the adapter connected to the nozzle tube of the original bottle. Hold the syringe with one hand and press it down for docking, and ensure the adapter and nozzle tube are connected vertically and tightly. Then pull up the syringe slowly to extract perfume.（You can also hold the syringe and constantly pressing the perfume nozzle tube to pump the perfume） ADAPTER FOR INJECCTION: Similar to extracting, you just need to replace the extraction tool with the injection tool, and slowly push down the syringe. This injection tool can let your high-quality brand perfume bottles be reused. No longer to regret that the perfume bottle can only be left idle or thrown away after using up the perfume. Recycling-glass can also reduce ecological damage and protect the earth. EFFICIENT REFILL FROM NOW: Before our perfume refill transfer tool appeared, people could only use traditional tools to pump so many times to transfer perfume, and the efficiency was slow. But our tools can achieve the effect of rapid extraction of quantitative perfume and one-time transfer. Greatly saves the time of repeated filling perfume. HOW WE START: With the development of high energy consumption glass products, our environment has been greatly damaged. In particular, the perfume manufacturing industry's demand for glass bottles is increasing, and at least one billion glass bottles are used globally every year. So how to make the original clamp perfume bottle can be reused is a problem we have been working hard to solve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vC6l9Fl6L._SL1418_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUB","source_asin":"B09TTBHX15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TTBHX15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TTBHX15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
