window.products.push({"id":1055679,"name":"ORKA Silicone Lid and Splatter Guard, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eynZcN+8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ingenious silicone lid and splatter screen by Mastrad is a must have for any kitchen. It allows for controlled cooking; the openings in the lid allow the desired amount of vapor to be released, preventing excessive condensation. When closed, it becomes a splatter guard or lid to keep surfaces clean. Generously sized to fit pans up to 11 inches in diameter. Made with high-quality silicone, it can withstand high-heat temperatures up to 400 degrees Fahrenheit. The hanging loop at the end of the handle adds another way to store this item in your kitchen. Easy to wash by hand; dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eynZcN+8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mastrad","source_asin":"B00XTRT1KG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XTRT1KG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XTRT1KG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1055680,"name":"Perfect Memories Premium 6ft Spandex Fitted Tablecloth Table Skirt (Black) - One-Piece, Wrinkle-Resistant Ruffles Installs in Seconds | Weddings, Banq","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mwcw8ogFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spandex Convenient one-piece design: Shopping separately for table skirts and tablecloths? What a pain. And just forget about trying to match your skirt to a tablecloth of the same color. You need the Perfect Memories fitted tablecloth and skirt combo! It’s made from one solid piece of stretchable spandex and covers your entire table, head to toe. Just what the party doctor ordered to make decorating fast and easy! Our table covers are 72'' in length and 30'' in width. Wrinkle-resistant spandex: Who has time to iron all those wrinkles out of polyester table cloths? When you’ve got a million party decorations to assemble, ironing unruly table covers can be downright maddening. That’s why ours is made from forgiving spandex, so creases won’t suck up precious setup time. Although some wrinkling can occur during shipping, a quick toss into the washer will take them right out. No elbow grease required! Ruffles add an elegant touch: Razzle-dazzle party guests with long, beautiful ruffles that turn any table into a total showstopper. Thanks to stretchy, wrinkle-resistant spandex, each gorgeous billow keeps its shape, so your table skirt stays looking fabulous throughout the entire event. It’s the perfect addition to your arsenal of party or catering supplies! No velcro, clips or tools: No fussing over velcro strips, tablecloth clips or tools. Your Perfect Memories banquet tablecloth comes in one easy-to-install piece -- no assembly required! Just pull it over any rectangular table and watch the magic unfold right before your eyes. It’s that easy! Easy to use and store: Unlike other skirts that are difficult to care for and store, ours is completely machine washable and easy to fold flat for quick transportation and storage. Just toss into the wash on “cold” and tumble dry on “low.” No dreaded “hand-wash only” or “air dry” requirements, here!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mwcw8ogFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Memories","source_asin":"B081P5B9G7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081P5B9G7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081P5B9G7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
