window.products.push({"id":1055721,"name":"12 Pack Foldable Shoe Storage Boxes, Shoe Boxes Clear Plastic Stackable with Front Magnetic Door, Ventilation and Dust-proof, Shoe Organizer Boxes for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lphSFJxoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👈 Watch the installation video to help you install the shoe box more easily. 👞【Organize Shoes Easily】- AKEYDIY clear plastic shoe box is suitable for daily shoe storage, say goodbye to mess and keep dust out of your shoes. You can stack the shoe boxes as you like to save space. Place your shoe into the shoes organizer to prevent messy in any room. AKEYDIY shoe storage box makes your life more organized and tidy. *The design of the shoe may cause the actual width of the shoe to be too large, you can store the shoes by orienting the soles to the sides which will save more space. 👟【Box Size & Strong Material】- Each shoe container size 12.9”L× 9”W × 5.5”H, suitable for size up to Men's 10, Women's 11. The shoe box is made of strong PP plastic, and doors are made of ABS plastic, strong enough to be stackable, preventing deformation or collapse. 👠【Stackable & Strong Stability】- The clear plastic stackable shoe box has an interlocking design, which can keep each box tightly connected to make the entire structure stable, and you can stack the shoe boxes as you want, in any space, in any number. It is a good choice to place it in the porch, under the bed, or in the storage room to save space. 👡【Transparent & Breathable】- Shoe storage boxes features a transparent door so you can quickly and easily find the shoe you need and it’s also a perfect way to show off your sneakers. The upgraded magnetic suction door can make the door close more tightly. Rear ventilated holes allow for air circulation and odor prevention. Help you to get rid of the unpleasant smell. ✅【Multiple Use Occasions】- More than a storage shoebox; These plastic shoe boxes can also store toys, socks, underwear, books, etc for easy access for the whole fam. They can be placed in the bedroom, living room, closet, under the bed, and any corner of the room. AKEYDIY shoe case complements any room in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lphSFJxoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKEYDIY","source_asin":"B0BCW8BDYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCW8BDYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCW8BDYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
