window.products.push({"id":1055775,"name":"Deitybless Wheat Straw Dinnerware Sets for 12pcs(Eco friendly & Reusable Plates, Cups, Bowls and Plate) Unbreakable Dinnerware Set, Microwave and Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KH8VCrtbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for the perfect Dinnerware Set? The Wheat Straw Dinnerware Sets! Dishes created to make your meals even more enjoyable. Practical Design Our dishes are designed to save space. The plates, cups and bowls easily stack inside of one another. It will help you to save on storage and easily pack them to school, work, picnics or camping trips. Moreover, the raised edges were designed to prevent spilling. Environmental friendliness and safety first Our dishes are made of natural Wheat Straw Fiber and food grade PP which is non-toxic and BPA free. Our Dinnerware is also very sturdy and durable - don’t worry about them falling down. Smooth round edges are designed to protect from cutting your skin. It makes them a great choice to have as kids dinnerware sets. Easy to clean with just water and soap If you don't want to be disappointed with the size - choose our product Package includes: 4x Plate: Width 7.8”, Height 1.3” 4x Bowl: Width 5.9”, Height 3”, Capacity 24oz 4x Cup: Width 3”, Height 4”, Capacity 12oz Each product comes in 5 colors: Beige, Green, Blue and Pink Care and Caution: Not intended for use with sharp utensils which may scratch the surface of the dinnerware. [Microwave] General reheating of food in microwave is acceptable. Not recommended for cooking food in microwave with packaging such as popcorn, pizza, hot pocket, pot pie that may overheat and damage the dinnerware. [Oven] Not for use in oven.[Dishwasher] Advisable to put on top rack (for dishwasher built in with ‘exposed’ heating element). To rinse and wash the dinnerware as soon as possible after serving to prevent any food residue and sauces from drying, hence staining. Clean with soft cloth or sponge if hand wash. Keep away from fire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KH8VCrtbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deitybless","source_asin":"B094WB74FJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094WB74FJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094WB74FJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
