window.products.push({"id":1055861,"name":"Carltina Stretch Sofa Slipcover Modern Striped Couch Cover for 3 Cushion Couch 1 Piece Jacquard Sofa Cover for Dogs Pets Non Slip Washable Furniture P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y+IbrZlqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Striped Design: Carltina magic couch cover adopted the most stylish design--Striped, which can create a clean crisp appearance for your living room while decorate your furniture. Crafted from polyester and spandex jacquard fabric for extra quality, this upgraded sofa cover is super soft, thicker, more stretchable and durable for long lifespan, bringing ultimately comfortable experience for you. All-around Protection:This stretch sofa cover can bring you sofa a full range of protection against dirt, dust, pet scratches and pet fur, daily tear and wears, greatly extending the lifetime of your furniture.Thanks to its elasticity and adaptability, this couch slipcover will not come off easily or roll up if compared to any other couch cover, providing a perfect look for your sofa and no more slide as well. Perfect Fit: When you choose a sofa cover for living room,color and size are two essential elements that you should consider. We offer 4 sizes and 12 vivid colors for you to choose from.What’s more,our universal sofa covers are stretchy enough to fit most type of couches. Small size for chairs is width up to 30-47 inch, Medium size for loveseat is width up to 56-70 inch, Large size for sofa cover is width up to 71-92 inch, X-Large sizes for oversized sofa cover is width up to 93-115 inch. Slip-Resistant: Featuring premium elastic band in the bottom and non slip foam rollers, our sofa slipcovers can guarantee they will stay in place tightly with no snag, no wrinkling, shifting or slipping even after sitting or taking a nap on it. Simply tuck foam rollers in the gap between the seat and sofa to create a snug fit just like the fitted sheets. Easy Care: Carltina sofa protector cover are also very easy to wash and maintain.They’ll look like a new one after washing. Hand wash & Machine wash at or below 30 degree Celsius. Do not iron or bleach. Please feel free to contact us for any washing or installation questions.We provide 24 hours service for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y+IbrZlqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carltina","source_asin":"B08DR98RNZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DR98RNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DR98RNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
