window.products.push({"id":1055904,"name":"Seki Japan MASAMUNE, Japanese Vegetable Kitchen Knife, Stainless Steel Professional Nakiri Knife, POM Handle, 6.3 inch (160mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+WPXM0ERL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thin Blade Knife specializes for cutting vegetables because of the thin and wide sword blade. The thin blade enables you to cut hard or big food materials easily by standing the blade upright on the food and putting your body weight on the knife. This thin blade knife allows you to peel vegetable or fruit skins easily and makes specialized cuts such as katsuramuki, shaving a vegetable cylinder into a thin sheet. When people go to buy a knife for their home use, the first thing that comes to mind is most likely stainless steel.There are indeed some merits associated with stainless steel knives. Rust resistance is top on the list for these merits. They are low maintenance and can be used for a long period of time. In fact, there are various grades and types of stainless steel used in kitchen knives, and professionals pay close attention to the type of stainless steel used in the knives they purchase. Blade length : 160mm / Blade : Molybdenum Stainless Steel, Handle : Plastic (POM Resin) *Please note that the package design is subject to change without notice. Seki city is known for its cutlery industry and manufactures the majority of cutlery, such as kitchen knives, Japanese swords, pocket knives, scissors, letter openers, etc., within the nation. The Seki cutlery is famous for its high quality not only domestically but also overseas. These strong and precise knives are made one by one by Japanese craftsmen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+WPXM0ERL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"product of gifu japan","source_asin":"B07MMT5DWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MMT5DWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MMT5DWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1055905,"name":"Pure Egyptian Full Size Cotton Bed Sheets Set (Full Size,800 Thread Count) Silver Bedding and Pillow Cases (4 Pc) – Egyptian Cotton Sheets Full Size B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k2ACGgAzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ LUXURIOUS FIVE-STAR HOTEL 100% COTTON SHEET SET: Crafted from 100% Extra Long-Staple Cotton, our sheet sets are softer and more durable for improved plushness. The 800 THREAD COUNT cotton bed sheets are buttery smooth and silky with a rich sateen weave that adds luminous touch to the bedding. These are heavyweight, cooling, and breathable for the ultimate five-star hotel luxury and all-season comfort ✔ WHAT COMES IN THE SET? Our 800 THREAD COUNT full size sheets set has 4 pieces: 1 Top Flat Sheet (81” W x 96” L), 1 Fitted Bottom Sheet (54” W x 75” L), and 2 Standard Size Pillowcases (20” W x 30” L). The fitted sheet has deep pockets to fit adjustable mattresses from 8 inches to 17 inches deep. Clever HEAD/FOOT Tags help you to make the bed easily. Pair this silver cotton bed sheets set with a matching comforter and duvet cover to elevate the home/room decor ✔ SAFE FOR YOU & YOUR FAMILY: Cotton is naturally-sourced and earth-friendly, unlike microfiber and other linens that are not ideal for your health and skin. At Thread Spread, we focus on healthy and quality living, and our luxury sheets are certified as STANDARD 100 BY OEKO-TEX to be free from toxins and harmful chemicals ✔ CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Thread Spread recommends washing the sheets at least once a week. You can either tumble dry or hang the sheets outside to dry. These egyptian cotton quality sheets are resistant to shrinking, fading, and pilling. The fabric opens up in a few washes and becomes softer and smoother. Remove these luxury bed sheets from the dryer as soon as the cycle ends to prevent wrinkles ✔ YOU MATTER THE MOST: We’re confident that you will love our full size sheet sets. In case you're unhappy with the purchase, we have a flexible return/refund policy to get the items exchanged or refunded. You can also gift our best Egyptian cotton quality sheets to your loved ones on Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Women’s Day, Men's Day, Christmas, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Weddings, Vacations, and Autumn Holidays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k2ACGgAzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B07R6Z5333","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R6Z5333","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R6Z5333","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
