window.products.push({"id":1055961,"name":"Leagel Fake Flowers Vintage Artificial Peony Silk Flowers Bouquet Wedding Home Decoration, Pack of 1 (Light Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uwCrAevTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Nice Workmanship: They are fabric petals, embossed with realistic-looking \"veins\", then dipped in or sprayed with a latex material, and glued to each other in a manner that mimics the design of real Peony. Friendly Suggestion: 1. Please gently spread the item after getting it, in case of falling the leaves and flowers. 2 . There would be accumulated dust if you put it in a place for very long time. You can use the hair dryer with cold wind to remove the dust. 3. Due to the difference on sunlight ,displays, configurations and diverse opinions on color, color shading is inevitable. 4. Please don't put it under strong sunshine. You'd better to dry it by the natural wind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uwCrAevTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leagel","source_asin":"B072MHPR23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072MHPR23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072MHPR23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1055962,"name":"Pomatree Storage Bins - 9 Pack - Durable Storage Cubes with Label Window | 2 Reinforced Handles | Fabric Cube Baskets for Organizing Closet, Clothes a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sqdbqQobL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We all need extra storage solutions in our spaces and our functional and foldable basket bins are so pretty and give you multiple storage options! They’ll hold and hide your belongings and look great while doing it! Plus, each cube features a large transparent label window with pre-cut labels so you can know the contents of the cube with just a glance. Stash items that make your place look messy and chaotic and restore peace, calm and serenity to your life! We’ve selected a neutral color palette for our storage baskets, so they blend easily into your décor and complement styles from modern sleek to rustic chic! Arrange them on your closet shelves for belts, scarves and handbags. Or, place them in your kids room for organizing kids clothes, stuffed animals and toys. And, they are the perfect size for sliding into a cube shelving organizer which gives you drawer-type storage, so you can easily pull out the fabric bin with the durable handles. Each cube features handles on both sides which will help you for easy handling and carrying. Purchase your first-rate, high quality set of storage cubes from Pomatree now so you can clear the clutter!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sqdbqQobL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pomatree","source_asin":"B086L8GYCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086L8GYCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086L8GYCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
