window.products.push({"id":1055979,"name":"Squirrel Houses. Nesting Box. 2 Units. by. M.HOLLEY. for Squirrel REHABE and Out Side USE. Best on Market.Fast 2 nd Work Day Shipping. ONLY by U.S.A. ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RSUskgEhL._AC_.jpg","description":"Made from real Ohio hard pine, all Holley wildlife houses are built to last. Ohio hard pine is a great insulator and--unlike red cedar, cyprus, plywood, or chipboard--is not aromatic. Aromatic woods will kill the young until aired out (which takes up to two years)! Holley wildlife houses are designed with the habits, needs, and protection of our wildlife friends in mind. Logos are branded on, not painted. Logos can be omitted if a plain house is desired, as every house is built to order. Because the houses are built to order, Made in the USA. BY U.S.A. VETERANS ONLY AND U.S.A. RAW MATERIALS. Sorry, no international shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RSUskgEhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holley","source_asin":"B003UVIOIQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1055979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003UVIOIQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003UVIOIQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
